            <p class="text-muted">KayÄ±tlÄ± binalarÄ± arayÄ±n, hatalÄ± olanÄ± seÃ§ip doÄŸru binanÄ±n iÃ§ine taÅŸÄ±yÄ±n.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/AdminLocation/Index" class="btn btn-light rounded-pill"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-2"></i> Geri DÃ¶n</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 mb-4">
